---
layout: base.njk
ogtype: article
---

<style>
.article-wrap {
  background: var(--linen);
  padding: calc(var(--nav-h) + 4rem) 2rem 6rem;
}

.article-inner {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.back-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  color: var(--salmon);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.post-cover {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(14,26,43,0.10);
}

.post-title {
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--ink);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
}

.post-meta {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: rgba(14,26,43,.55);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.post-body {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.85;
  color: rgba(14,26,43,.78);
}

.post-body p {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.post-body strong {
  color: var(--ink);
}

.post-body h2,
.post-body h3 {
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.post-body a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 2px;
}

.post-note {
  margin-top: 3rem;
  padding-top: 2rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(14,26,43,0.12);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: rgba(14,26,43,0.55);
}

.post-note p {
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.post-note a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 2px;
}

.post-cta {
  margin-top: 3rem;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: white;
  padding: 2rem;
  border-radius: 18px;
}

.post-cta h3 {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: white;
}

.post-cta p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
}

.post-cta a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 2px;
  font-weight: 500;
}
</style>

<main class="article-wrap">
  <article class="article-inner">

    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to all posts</a>

    {% if image %}
      <img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ title }}" class="post-cover">
    {% endif %}

    <h1 class="post-title">{{ title }}</h1>

    <div class="post-meta">
      By {{ author }}
    </div>

    <div class="post-body">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>

    <div class="post-note">
      <p>
        If you’d like to read more about what led Belinda to build NAVO, you can visit
        <a href="https://belindascott.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener">belindascott.co</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        NAVO blog articles are based on personal experience and general information only. They are not legal, medical, financial or aged care advice. Please speak with a qualified lawyer, medical practitioner, financial adviser or relevant care professional about your own situation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="post-cta">
      <h3>Not sure where to start?</h3>
      <p>Take the free 15-minute check-in and see what you know, what’s missing, and where to begin.</p>
      <a href="https://tally.so/r/gDN0BP" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start the free check-in →</a>
    </div>

  </article>
</main>
